                                                                                  rdfs:label "exceptions001" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#exceptions_for_transfers_or_international_communications001
<http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#exceptions_for_transfers_or_international_communications001> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
