                                                                                                                   <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#General_detail> "These are scenarios in which the approval of the personal data authority is not required to make use of personal data." ;
                                                                                                                   rdfs:label "exceptions to consent for national transfer001" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#exceptions_to_rights001
<http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#exceptions_to_rights001> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
