###  http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#members_of_the_protection_system001
<http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#members_of_the_protection_system001> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                                 <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Members_of_the_protection_system_in_verification> ;
