                                                                                                        <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Details_of_the_law_details> "Juan Antonio Encargado" ;
                                                                                                        <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Members_of_the_protection_system_details> """It has the following members:
- Personal Data Protection Authority
- Personal Data Delegate
- Recipient
- Data Controller
- Personal data processor
- Responsible for the processing of personal data""" ;
                                                                                                        rdfs:label "members of the protection system001" .


