###  http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#personal_data_security001
<http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#personal_data_security001> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
