                                                                                              <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Personal_data_security_details> "Those responsible for the security of personal data are the data processor and the data controller." ;
                                                                                              <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Prevent> "Prevent a threat or vulnerability" ;
                                                                                              <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Reduce> "Reducing risk" ;
                                                                                              <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Risk> "Risk in the event of a fault" ;
                                                                                              <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Secrecy_of_communications> "Communications must be secret" ;
