                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#has_the_following_principles_to_consider> <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#principles001> ;
                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Accurate> "They are accurate" ;
                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Clarity_and_accuracy> "Fundamental properties of a principle" ;
                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Clear> "The principles must be clear" ;
                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Complete> "They are complete" ;
                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Confidentiality> "They play a role in confidentiality" ;
                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Conservation> "Help in data preservation" ;
                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Exact> "They are accurate" ;
                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Explicit> "Explicit purpose" ;
                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#General_detail> "They are a mechanism by which the holder's information is safeguarded, they help to ensure the correct use of the information." ;
                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Integral> "They are integral" ;
                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Legitimate> "Legitimate purpose" ;
                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Personal_data_security_details> "They fulfill a security role" ;
                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Purpose> "They have a purpose" ;
                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Risk> "They may have a risk" ;
                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Threat> "Prevent a threat" ;
                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Transparency> "Verify data transparency" ;
                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Verifiable> "The principles are verifiable" ;
                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Vulnerabilidad> "Help to avoid vulnerabilities" ;
                                                                                  rdfs:label "principles001" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#public_administrations001
