                                                                                                   <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Disabled_owner_data> ;
                                                                                          rdfs:label "disabled owner data" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#exceptions_from_rights_for_the_right_to_automated_assessments
<http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#exceptions_from_rights_for_the_right_to_automated_assessments> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                                                             <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Exceptions_of_rights> ;
                                                                                                                                    <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#for> <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#right_not_to_be_object_to_automated_evaluations> ;
                                                                                                                                    <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#rights_to_not_be_the_object_of_automated_assessments> "Is based on the explicit consent of the owner" ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               "It is authorized by the applicable regulations, court order, resolution or reasoned mandate of the competent technical authority, for which adequate measures must be established to safeguard the fundamental rights and freedoms of the holder." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               "The automated decision does not entail serious impacts or verifiable risks for the owner" ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               "The automated decision is necessary for the conclusion or performance of a contract between the data subject and the controller or processor of personal data." ;
                                                                                                                                    <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#the_right_to_not_be_object_to_automated_assessments_may_not_be_revocable> "A data subject cannot be made to waive the right not to be subject to automated valuations in advance by means of contracts" ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   "When a decision is made based only on automated assessments, the data subject must be clearly informed of his or her right not to be subjected to these automated assessments" ;
                                                                                                                                    rdfs:label "exceptions from rights for the right to automated assessments" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#exceptions_to_rights_for_rectification_update_deletion_and_opposition
<http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#exceptions_to_rights_for_rectification_update_deletion_and_opposition> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                                                                     <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Exceptions_of_rights> ;
                                                                                                                                            <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#for> <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#right_of_deletion> ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                      <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#right_of_opposition> ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                      <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#right_to_correction_and_update> ;
                                                                                                                                            <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#rights_to_correct_update_update_delete_and_oppose> "If the applicant is not the owner of the personal data or his legal representative is not duly accredited." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    "In situations where the public interest is involved, the processing of personal data will be allowed, as long as international human rights standards are respected, the principles of the Organic Law for the Protection of Personal Data are complied with and the minimum criteria established by this law are followed." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    "In the processing of personal data that are necessary for the filing of information that is part of the State's patrimony, for scientific, historical or statistical research." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    "When it may cause damage to rights or affect the legitimate interests of third parties and this is accredited by the database controller at the time of responding to the data subject's request to exercise the respective right, i.e., if the database controller can demonstrate that complying with the data subject's request could damage the rights or legitimate interests of other persons, then it may refuse to comply with the request." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    "When it may hinder judicial or administrative proceedings in progress, duly notified." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    "When the data are necessary for the formulation, exercise or defense of claims or appeals." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    "When the data are necessary to comply with a court order, resolution or reasoned mandate from a competent public authority." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    "When the data are necessary to exercise the right to freedom of expression and opinion." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    "When the data is necessary for the fulfillment of a legal or contractual obligation." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    "When the data is necessary to protect the vital interest of the data subject or another natural person." ;
                                                                                                                                            rdfs:label "exceptions to rights for rectification update deletion and opposition" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#exercise_of_rights
<http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#exercise_of_rights> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Exercise_of_rights> ;
                                                                                         <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#description> "Ability of the data subject to access information and training related to the proper use and processing of his or her personal data." ;
                                                                                         <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#must_provide_training_and_information> "Civil society organizations" ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                     "Educational entities" ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                     "Providers of information and knowledge society services" ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                     "State" ;
                                                                                         rdfs:comment "Ability of the data subject to access information and training related to the proper use and processing of his or her personal data."@en ,
                                                                                                      "Ability of the data subject to access information and training related to the proper use and processing of his or her personal data."@es ;
                                                                                         rdfs:label "exercise of rights" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#family_or_domestic_activities
<http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#family_or_domestic_activities> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                             <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Family_or_domestic_activities> ;
                                                                                                    <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#in_case_of_processing_it_must_be_compliant_with> <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#principios> ;
                                                                                                    <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#explanation_of_concept_of_inapplicability> "Refers to those actions related to family and family relationships. In this context, the use of personal data could be associated with family matters, exchange of information between family members or other activities that take place within the family environment." ;
                                                                                                    rdfs:label "family or domestic activities" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#genetic_data
<http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#genetic_data> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                            <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Genetic_data> ;
                                                                                   <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#description> "Unique personal data related to inherited or acquired genetic characteristics of a natural person that provide unique information about an individual's physiology or health." ;
                                                                                   rdfs:comment "Unique personal data related to inherited or acquired genetic characteristics of a natural person that provide unique information about an individual's physiology or health."@en ,
                                                                                                "Unique personal data related to inherited or acquired genetic characteristics of a natural person that provide unique information about an individual's physiology or health."@es ;
                                                                                   rdfs:label "genetic data" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#health_related_data
<http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#health_related_data> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                   <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Health_Related_Data> ;
                                                                                          <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#description> "Personal data relating to the physical or mental health of an individual, including the provision of health care services, which reveal information about his or her health status" ;
                                                                                          rdfs:comment "Personal data relating to the physical or mental health of an individual, including the provision of health care services, which reveal information about his or her health status"@en ,
                                                                                                       "Personal data relating to the physical or mental health of an individual, including the provision of health care services, which reveal information about his or her health status"@es ;
                                                                                          rdfs:label "health related data" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#health_related_data_processing
<http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#health_related_data_processing> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                              <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Health_related_data_processing> ;
                                                                                                     <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#in_respect_to_the> <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#consent> ;
                                                                                                     <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#shall_be_authorized_by> <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#personal_data_protection_authority> ;
                                                                                                     <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#application_scenarios_for_processing_of_data_without_consent> "Treatment is necessary for reasons of public interest in the field of public health, such as in situations of serious health threats that transcend borders." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        "Treatment is necessary to ensure high standards of quality and safety in medical care, medicines or medical devices." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        "When the data processing is related to preventive medicine, the assessment of work capacity, medical diagnosis, the provision of medical or social assistance, or the management of health and social services." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        "When treatment is vital to protect the patient's life and the patient is unable to give consent due to physical or legal status" ;
                                                                                                     <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#health-related_data_collection_and_processing> "The institutions that make up the National Health System and health professionals may collect and process data related to the health of their patients who are or have been under treatment by those institutions." ;
                                                                                                     <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#purposes_of_the_processing_of_data_by_private_and_public_entities> "Scientific research purposes" ;
                                                                                                     <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#scenarios_for_treatment_by_private_and_public_entities> "Provided that the data processing is authorized by the Personal Data Protection Authority." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  "Provided that the data used for the research are anonymized." ;
                                                                                                     <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#supervise_treatment_in_health_service_management_activities> "Data processing in activities related to the management of health and social services may only be carried out by professionals subject to the duty of professional secrecy or under their supervision." ;
                                                                                                     rdfs:label "health related data processing" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#holder_between_15_to_17_years_old
<http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#holder_between_15_to_17_years_old> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
