###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#right_to_information
<http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#right_to_information> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                    <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Right_to_information> ;
                                                                                           <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#must_be_aware_of_the_possibility_of_realizing> <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#revocation_of_consent> ;
                                                                                           <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#must_comply_with_the_principles_of> <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#loyalty> ,
