                                                                                                       <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#assumptions_for_processing_the_data_in_the_event_of_a_data_challenge> "Claims defense" ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  "Claims exercise" ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  "Formulation of claims" ;
                                                                                                       <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#conditions_for_the_suspension_of_treatment> "The controller no longer needs the personal data for the purposes of the processing, but the data subject needs the data for the formulation, exercise or defense of claims" ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                        "The processing is unlawful and the data subject opposes the deletion of the personal data and requests instead the limitation of its use." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                        "When the data subject contests the accuracy of the personal data, while the data controller verifies the accuracy of the personal data" ;
                                                                                                       <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#description> "The data subject shall have the right to obtain from the data controller the suspension of data processing, when certain scenarios are met" ;
                                                                                                       <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#incurring_the_owner_to_the_personal_data_protection_authority> "In the event that the data controller or processor refuses to suspend the processing of the data requested by the data subject" ;
                                                                                                       rdfs:comment "The data subject shall have the right to obtain from the data controller the suspension of data processing, when certain scenarios are met"@en ,
                                                                                                                    "The data subject shall have the right to obtain from the data controller the suspension of data processing, when certain scenarios are met"@es ;
                                                                                                       rdfs:label "right to suspension of treatment" .


