                                                                             <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#description_responsible_for_channeling_exercise_of_rights> "It involves consideration of the individuals responsible for ensuring that the rights of the holder are properly exercised." ;
                                                                             <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#irrevocability> "The holder's rights are non-transferable and cannot be waived; therefore, any clause or provision that contradicts this will be considered null and void." ;
                                                                             <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#limitation_on_exercise_of_rights_by_secondary_laws> "Regulations or rules complementary to the Personal Data Protection Law may not restrict or limit the rights of the owner." ;
                                                                             <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#responsible_for_channeling_the_exercise_of_rights> "Competent judges in accordance with the procedure established in the Organic Law on Personal Data Protection." ;
                                                                             rdfs:label "rights" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#rights_of_credit_data_owners
<http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#rights_of_credit_data_owners> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                            <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Rights_of_credit_data_owners> ;
                                                                                                   <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#mechanisms_to_secure_the_right_of_access_of_the_credit_data_holder> "Delivery of printouts of the reports so that the owner of the credit data can verify the veracity and accuracy of its content, without being able to use it for credit or commercial purposes." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            "Direct observation through screens that the credit reference service providers will make available on the holder of credit data" ;
                                                                                                   <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#right_to_access_by_credit_data_holders> "As often as requested by the credit data subject with respect to the information that credit reference service providers have about him/her." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                "It shall be free of charge" ;
                                                                                                   <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#right_to_update_correction_or_deletion_of_the_credit_data_holder> "The owner of the credit data may demand the right to update, rectify or delete the credit data before the sources of information through a written request." ;
                                                                                                   <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#rights_of_credit_data_holders> "Personal access to the information of which it is the owner of credit data." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                       "That the credit report allows to know clearly and accurately the condition of your credit history." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                       "That the sources of information update, rectify or eliminate, as the case may be, information that is unlawful, false, inaccurate, erroneous, incomplete or outdated." ;
                                                                                                   <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#source_of_information_activity_on_the_application> "If the credit data review process is initiated, it is necessary to clearly indicate in the reports issued that the information that is the subject of the request is being reviewed at the request of the holder." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "The sources of information must resolve the request within a maximum period of 15 days from its submission, either admitting it or rejecting it with a detailed explanation of the reasons" ;
                                                                                                   rdfs:label "rights of credit data owners" .


