                                                                                <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#will_be_imposed_by> <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#personal_data_protection_authority> ;
                                                                                rdfs:label "sanciones" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#scope_of_application
<http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#scope_of_application> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                    <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Scope_of_application> ;
                                                                                           <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#scope_of_legislation> "The law will apply to the processing of personal data regardless of the medium in which it is stored, whether in automated or non-automated formats. This implies that the law is equally applicable to data stored in automated systems, such as electronic databases, as well as to data that may exist in non-automated formats, such as physical documents or paper files." ;
                                                                                           rdfs:label "scope of application" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#security
<http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#security> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                        <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Security> ;
                                                                               <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#responsible_for_implementing_safety_measures> <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#data_processor> ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                  <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#responsible_for_treatment> ;
                                                                               <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#description> "Implementation of adequate and necessary measures to protect personal data against risks, threats and vulnerabilities, considering the current state of technology" ;
                                                                               <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#types_of_safety_measures> "Organizational measures, i.e. measures that refer to the internal policies, procedures and structures that an organization implements to protect personal data." ,
                                                                                                                                                                              "Technical measures, i.e. measures that involve the use of technology to protect personal data, these may include the use of firewalls, data encryption, intrusion detection software, biometric access controls, among others." ,
                                                                                                                                                                              "Type of measures covering aspects such as physical security of equipment and data centers, risk management, business continuity and security incident response." ;
                                                                               rdfs:comment "Implementation of adequate and necessary measures to protect personal data against risks, threats and vulnerabilities, considering the current state of technology"@en ,
                                                                                            "Implementation of adequate and necessary measures to protect personal data against risks, threats and vulnerabilities, considering the current state of technology"@es ;
                                                                               rdfs:label "security" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#sensitive_data
<http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#sensitive_data> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                              <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Sensitive_data> ;
                                                                                     <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#shall_at_least_comply_with_the_minimum_with> <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#minimum_criteria> ;
                                                                                     <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#data_not_subject_to_processing_according_to_the_right_to_not_be_the_object_of_automated_decisions> "Sensitive data of children and adolescents may not be processed unless expressly authorized by the legal representative." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             "Sensitive data of the data subject may not be processed without his/her express authorization." ;
                                                                                     <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#data_related_to> "Cultural identity" ,
                                                                                                                                                                           "Datos biométricos" ,
                                                                                                                                                                           "Ethnicity" ,
                                                                                                                                                                           "Gender Identity" ,
                                                                                                                                                                           "Genetic data" ,
                                                                                                                                                                           "Health" ,
                                                                                                                                                                           "Ideology" ,
                                                                                                                                                                           "Judicial past" ,
                                                                                                                                                                           "Migratory status" ,
                                                                                                                                                                           "Political affiliation" ,
                                                                                                                                                                           "Religion" ,
                                                                                                                                                                           "Sexual Orientation" ,
                                                                                                                                                                           "Stateless persons and refugees in need of international protection" ,
                                                                                                                                                                           "Those whose improper treatment may give rise to discrimination, infringe or may infringe fundamental rights and freedoms." ;
                                                                                     <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#data_subjects_to_treatment_according_to_the_right_to_not_be_the_object_of_automated_decisions> "When the processing is necessary to protect an essential public interest, as assessed according to international human rights standards, and meets at least the minimum criteria" ;
                                                                                     <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#description> "Refers to information specific or linked to certain sensitive or particular categories of a person." ;
                                                                                     rdfs:comment "Refers to information specific or linked to certain sensitive or particular categories of a person."@en ,
                                                                                                  "Refers to information specific or linked to certain sensitive or particular categories of a person."@es ;
                                                                                     rdfs:label "sensitive data" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#sensitive_data_processing
<http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#sensitive_data_processing> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                         <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Sensitive_data_processing> ;
                                                                                                <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#description> "The processing of sensitive personal data is prohibited, except in specific situations where it is justified." ;
                                                                                                <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#sensitive_data_processing_scenarios> "The owner has given his/her explicit consent for the processing of his/her personal data, clearly specifying the purposes for which the data is to be processed." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                          "The processing is necessary for archiving purposes in the public interest, scientific or historical research purposes or statistical purposes." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                          "The processing is necessary for the performance of obligations and exercise of rights specific to the controller or the data subject in the field of labor law, social security and social protection." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                          "The processing is necessary to protect the vital interests of the data subject or of another natural person, in the event that the data subject is physically or legally incapable of giving consent." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                          "The processing relates to personal data that the data subject has manifestly made public" ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                          "Treatment is performed by order of a judicial authority." ;
                                                                                                rdfs:comment "The processing of sensitive personal data is prohibited, except in specific situations where it is justified."@en ,
                                                                                                             "The processing of sensitive personal data is prohibited, except in specific situations where it is justified."@es ;
                                                                                                rdfs:label "sensitive data processing" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#serious_infractions
<http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#serious_infractions> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                   <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Serious_infractions> ;
                                                                                          <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#committed_by> <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#data_processor> ,
                                                                                                                                                                             <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#personal_data_protection_authority> ,
                                                                                                                                                                             <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#responsible_for_treatment> .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#source_accessible_to_the_public
<http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#source_accessible_to_the_public> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                               <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Source_accessible_to_the_public> ;
                                                                                                      <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#description> "Databases that can be consulted by any person" ;
                                                                                                      <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#has_the_characteristic_of_being> "Generalized, i.e. indicates that access is widely available and available to a large audience" ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                            "Public access" ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                            "Unconditional, i.e. access is not subject to specific restrictions or conditions, therefore, anyone can access without the need to comply with particular requirements or restrictions." ;
                                                                                                      rdfs:comment "Databases that can be consulted by any person"@en ,
                                                                                                                   "Databases that can be consulted by any person"@es ;
                                                                                                      rdfs:label "source accessible to the public" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#special_personal_data_categories
<http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#special_personal_data_categories> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                                <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Special_personal_data_categories> ;
                                                                                                       <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#special_categories_of_personal_data_are_composed_of> <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#data_under_17_years_old> ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#disabled_owner_data> ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#health_related_data> ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#sensitive_data> ;
                                                                                                       <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#description> "Refers to sensitive information that requires additional protection due to its sensitive or potentially damaging nature if misused." ;
                                                                                                       rdfs:comment "Refers to sensitive information that requires additional protection due to its sensitive or potentially damaging nature if misused."@en ,
                                                                                                                    "Refers to sensitive information that requires additional protection due to its sensitive or potentially damaging nature if misused."@es ;
                                                                                                       rdfs:label "special personal data categories" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#specialized_subject_data
<http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#specialized_subject_data> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                        <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Specialized_subject_data> ;
                                                                                               <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#shall_at_least_comply_with_the_minimum_with> <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#minimum_criteria> ;
                                                                                               <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#description> "Data subject to specific regulations established by other Ecuadorian or foreign laws." ;
                                                                                               <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#regulated_treatment_in_specialized_regulations_regarding> "Datos en materia de desastres naturales, es decir, eventos catastróficos causados por fenómenos naturales como terremotos, huracanes, inundaciones, incendios forestales, entre otros, que pueden causar daños significativos a la vida, la propiedad y el medio ambiente" ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                              "Datos en materia de sectores regulados, es decir, áreas de actividad que están sujetas a regulaciones detalladas y específicas establecidas por leyes o normativas sectoriales ecuatoriana" ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                              "Freedom of expression data, i.e. the fundamental right of individuals to express their opinions, ideas and thoughts without censorship or repression by the State or other entities" ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                              "National security and state defense data, i.e. activities and policies aimed at protecting the territorial integrity, sovereignty and national interests of a country against internal and external threats, including acts of terrorism, espionage and military aggression." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                              "Personal data provided to administrative or judicial authorities, i.e. personal data that must be provided to government authorities, whether administrative (e.g. government agencies) or judicial (e.g. courts), in compliance with lawful requests supported by law and in the exercise of their lawful powers." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                              "Risk management data, i.e., processes and practices used to identify, assess and mitigate potential risks faced by organizations in their business activities or service delivery." ;
                                                                                               <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#will_be_subject_to> "If necessary, compliance with international human rights standards shall be ensured." ,
                                                                                                                                                                                        "Principles established in specialized regulations" ,
                                                                                                                                                                                        "Principles of the Organic Law for the Protection of Personal Data" ;
                                                                                               rdfs:comment "Data subject to specific regulations established by other Ecuadorian or foreign laws."@en ,
                                                                                                            "Data subject to specific regulations established by other Ecuadorian or foreign laws."@es ;
                                                                                               rdfs:label "specialized subject data" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#successor_right_holder
<http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#successor_right_holder> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                      <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Successor_right_holder> ;
                                                                                             <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#description> "Person or entity legally appointed to represent and exercise the rights and obligations related to the personal data of a deceased individual." ;
                                                                                             <http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#exercise_of_rights_by_the_deceased_owner> "To contact the person responsible for the processing of personal data in order to request access, rectification and updating or deletion of the personal data of the deceased person he/she represents." ;
                                                                                             rdfs:comment "Person or entity legally appointed to represent and exercise the rights and obligations related to the personal data of a deceased individual."@en ,
                                                                                                          "Person or entity legally appointed to represent and exercise the rights and obligations related to the personal data of a deceased individual."@es ;
                                                                                             rdfs:label "successor right holder" .


